> combined with the random teleport on failure (so there's a risk if you 
> try it that it'll now be *harder* to get where you're going, but it'll 
> usually help).

DEFINITELY won't get used combined with no 100% range.

> Otherwise it risks
> turning into "walk through the easy parts of Gehennom and teleport
